body: "Official Home Assistant 2026.7 documentation specifies supported_features with coalesce_messages as the first post-auth command and an admin-only subscribe_trigger contract accepting one or more automation triggers plus optional variables. Current Core dev source validates trigger configs, emits event messages containing variables/context, and uses unsubscribe_events for cleanup. The live configured Core accepts both contracts. The CLI currently supports only subscribe_events and assumes every incoming frame is one JSON object."
